The country_data_export file contains the Google Earth Engine script used to find
and export the following key datasets for each country in the study:

1. Tropical moist forests (TMF) - forest cover and deforestation
2. Climate hazards infrared precipitation with stations (CHIRPS) - precipitation
3. ERA5-Land - mean air temperature
4. World database on protected areas (WDPA) - Protected area extent

The script can also be accessed and run at the following URL with an active
Google Earth Engine account:

https://code.earthengine.google.com/?accept_repo=users/guylomax01/Lomax_deforestation_counterfactuals